      "batch_size": 1,
      "hardware_label": "RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell",
      "notes": "Automated 3-run llama-benchy 0.4.0 measurement of the custom selective EXL3 3.0bpw artifact. Fixed 512-token prompt and 1024-token output, batch 1, cold prefix cache, exact output length, temperature=0. Output 193.80 ± 12.60 tok/s; prefill 3,712.33 ± 207.24 tok/s; TTFT 177.14 ± 8.03 ms; peak one-second output 281 ± 47 tok/s. Logical checkpoint TP4 is folded onto two physical TP workers (two serialized 512-wide K3 slices per GPU). DFlash2 TP2 speculative decoding uses seven draft tokens and CUDA graphs. GPU power values are means during samples at >=50% utilization. Peak VRAM is the sum of per-card peaks. GPU 0 also drives the Hyprland desktop. Experimental custom loader; source checkpoint revision 8b099bf276507a17faea920deff3f62d5597fb52 preserved unchanged.",
